# Vitalik's QAP example - all private inputs
# Prove: x^3 + x + 5 = 35 (without revealing x)
# From: https://medium.com/@VitalikButerin/quadratic-arithmetic-programs-from-zero-to-hero-f6d558cea649

decl private x

# Flatten x^3: sym_1 = x * x (x^2)
sym_1 = x * x

# y = sym_1 * x (x^3)
y = sym_1 * x

# Compute x^3 + x
sym_2 = y + x

# Compute x^3 + x + 5
out = sym_2 + 5

# Enforce out == 35
thirty_five = 35
check = out == thirty_five
